def find_duplicates_optimized(items):
    seen = set()
    dups = set()
    for item in items:
        if item in seen:
            dups.add(item)
        else:
            seen.add(item)
    return list(dups)
```
**Explanation**: Time complexity drops from O(N^2) to O(N) by using hash sets for O(1) lookup speeds.

